# Supabase root CA bundle for cloud sync (CLOUD_SYNC_SUPABASE_CA_FILE).
#
# Paste the two certificates below this header, one after the other:
#   prod-ca-2021.crt and prod-ca-2025.crt
# from https://github.com/supabase/cli, folder
#   apps/cli-go/internal/gen/types/templates/
#
# They verify the session pooler's certificate (sslmode=verify-full) for
# the connection test, the preflight and the import's dump container.
# Lines outside BEGIN/END CERTIFICATE blocks are ignored. Until a
# certificate is here, imports refuse to connect unless
# CLOUD_SYNC_ALLOW_UNVERIFIED_TLS=true.
